    "name": "Valuation",
    "description": "FOB only where a source documents it. _Z is deliberately \"not established\" rather than \"not applicable\": Eurostat import value is conventionally CIF at the frontier, but this repo has not verified that, and a guessed valuation is worse than an absent one.",
